                                "sense_id": "fbe85362-fce4-3bd3-968c-26e8962a17ef",
                                "text": "The Noctidial Day, the Lunar Periodic Month, and the Solar Year are Natural and Universal; but Incommensurate each to other, and difficult to be reconciled: Yet we are constrained to make use of them, as Measures […]"
